WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
small wall

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:11,050
What little wall are you doing?

3
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:12,050
I am mother

4
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:14,880
Don't you remember?

5
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:15,880
Whose mother are you?

6
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,880
You can give birth to such a beautiful son like me

7
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:20,070
Are you still angry with your mother?

8
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:23,070
Mom never let you go to work in the mine

9
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:24,070
Mom was wrong

10
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:25,070
you forgive mom

11
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:28,070
You don’t even recognize your mother and want to die

12
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,070
OK OK OK

13
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:30,070
I am your son Xiaoqiang

14
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:32,070
Mom, I'm back

15
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:38,850
Go home with mom to the small wall

16
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:39,850
who is he

17
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:41,360
your daughter-in-law

18
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:42,360
Mom has money for you

19
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,360
Saved a lot of money

20
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:45,360
I'll sell the house to Uncle Zhang next door later.
